#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:258
msgid "Parsing Vimeo video and feed item contents."
msgstr "Vimeo-video's en de inhoud van feeditems verwerken."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:284
msgid "Vimeo Campaign Type."
msgstr "Campagnetype Vimeo."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:285
msgid ""
"Paste the address of a Vimeo user, channel or group and the campaign finds "
"its feed on its own:"
msgstr ""
"Plak het adres van een Vimeo-gebruiker, -kanaal of -groep en de campagne "
"vindt de feed zelf:"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:289
msgid ""
"Each item brings the title, the thumbnail, the player and the short "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Elk item brengt de titel, de miniatuur, de speler en de korte beschrijving "
"mee."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:290
msgid ""
"Vimeo publishes only the last 10 videos of each one, so a campaign that runs "
"often enough never misses any."
msgstr ""
"Vimeo publiceert er telkens maar de laatste 10 video's van, dus een campagne "
"die vaak genoeg draait, mist er geen."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:293
msgid "Use [embed]."
msgstr "[embed] gebruiken."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:294
msgid ""
"Wrap the video in the WordPress [embed] shortcode instead of the iframe "
"Vimeo shares."
msgstr ""
"De video in de WordPress-shortcode [embed] zetten in plaats van de iframe "
"die Vimeo aanbiedt."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:297
msgid "Video sizes."
msgstr "Videoformaten."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:298
msgid "Width and height of the video frame in the post."
msgstr "Breedte en hoogte van het videokader in het bericht."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:299
msgid "Leave them at 0 (zero) to keep it responsive."
msgstr "Laat ze op 0 (nul) staan om het responsive te houden."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:310
msgid "Vimeo Campaign Options"
msgstr "Vimeo-campagneopties"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:337
msgid "Featured Image"
msgstr "Uitgelichte afbeelding"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:341
msgid "Post Title"
msgstr "Berichttitel"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:349
msgid "The short description of the video, as published on Vimeo."
msgstr "De korte beschrijving van de video, zoals gepubliceerd op Vimeo."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:356
msgid "Use the [embed] WordPress shortcode instead of the Vimeo iframe."
msgstr ""
"De WordPress-shortcode [embed] gebruiken in plaats van de Vimeo-iframe."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:358
msgid "Change the size of the video frame."
msgstr "De grootte van het videokader wijzigen."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:367
msgid "Use it only as featured image"
msgstr "Alleen als uitgelichte afbeelding gebruiken"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:394
msgid "Vimeo API"
msgstr "Vimeo-API"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:395
msgid "PRO Feature"
msgstr "PRO-functie"

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:399
msgid "Fetch through the Vimeo API instead of the feed."
msgstr "Ophalen via de Vimeo-API in plaats van via de feed."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:402
msgid ""
"Professional reads Vimeo through its API: as many videos as the Items limit "
"asks for instead of the last 10, in the order you choose, and your private "
"and unlisted ones."
msgstr ""
"Professional leest Vimeo via de API: zoveel video's als de itemlimiet vraagt "
"in plaats van de laatste 10, in de volgorde die je kiest, en ook je privé- "
"en verborgen video's."

#: includes/campaign-types/vimeo.php:55 includes/module/actions.php:185
msgid "Vimeo"
msgstr "Vimeo"

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:125
msgid "Dismiss this notice."
msgstr "Deze melding sluiten."

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:126
msgid "Type at least one feed address."
msgstr "Vul ten minste één feedadres in."

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:127
msgid "Type the new feed addresses."
msgstr "Vul de nieuwe feedadressen in."

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:128 includes/campaigns_list.php:315
msgid "Running Campaign..."
msgstr "Campagne wordt uitgevoerd…"

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:129
msgid "Save the campaign before running it"
msgstr "Sla de campagne op voordat je hem uitvoert"

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:130
msgid "Save the campaign before this action"
msgstr "Sla de campagne op vóór deze actie"

#: includes/campaign_edit.php:131
msgid "Are you sure you want to reset this campaign?"
msgstr "Weet je zeker dat je deze campagne wilt resetten?"

