msgid "The Extensions menu stops asking our site for the add-on catalogue."
msgstr "Het menu Extensies vraagt onze site niet meer om de catalogus."

#: includes/settings/help.php:299
msgid ""
"You will see an empty page, or only the extensions you already have "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Je ziet een lege pagina, of alleen de extensies die je al hebt geïnstalleerd."

#: includes/settings/help.php:30
msgid ""
"A copy of every image found in the feed item (only in %s tags) is saved to "
"your Uploads folder. Off, images stay on the source server."
msgstr ""
"Van elke afbeelding in het feed-item (alleen in %s-tags) wordt een kopie in "
"je uploadsmap opgeslagen. Uit blijven de afbeeldingen op de server van de "
"bron staan."

#: includes/settings/help.php:302 includes/settings/page.php:784
msgid "Enable XML uploads"
msgstr "XML-uploads toestaan"

#: includes/settings/help.php:303
msgid ""
"Lets you upload XML files to the Media library, to use them in an XML "
"campaign."
msgstr ""
"Laat je XML-bestanden naar de mediabibliotheek uploaden om ze in een XML-"
"campagne te gebruiken."

#: includes/settings/help.php:306 includes/settings/page.php:830
msgid "Decode HTML entities on publish"
msgstr "HTML-entiteiten decoderen bij publiceren"

#: includes/settings/help.php:307
msgid ""
"Turns entities such as &amp;amp; back into their character before the post "
"is saved. Useful with feeds that encode the content twice."
msgstr ""
"Zet entiteiten als &amp;amp; terug om in hun teken voordat het bericht wordt "
"opgeslagen. Handig bij feeds die de inhoud dubbel coderen."

#: includes/settings/help.php:31
msgid ""
"Linking to the source server saves space and makes your pages faster, but "
"you lose the image the day the source removes it. Each campaign can set this "
"on its own."
msgstr ""
"Naar de bronserver linken bespaart ruimte en maakt je pagina’s sneller, maar "
"je raakt de afbeelding kwijt op de dag dat de bron haar weghaalt. Elke "
"campagne kan dit zelf bepalen."

#: includes/settings/help.php:312
msgid "Sender email"
msgstr "E-mail van de afzender"

#: includes/settings/help.php:313
msgid "The address every email from this plugin is sent from."
msgstr "Het adres waarvandaan elke e-mail van deze plugin wordt verstuurd."

#: includes/settings/help.php:316
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Naam van de afzender"

#: includes/settings/help.php:317
msgid "The name shown next to that address in your inbox."
msgstr "De naam die naast dat adres in je inbox staat."

#: includes/settings/help.php:329
msgid "Features available with the Professional add-on."
msgstr "Functies die je met de extensie Professional krijgt."

#: includes/settings/help.php:330
msgid ""
"Publish or skip an item depending on the keywords found in its title or "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Een item publiceren of overslaan op grond van de trefwoorden in de titel of "
"de inhoud."

#: includes/settings/help.php:331
msgid ""
"Cut, publish or skip an item depending on how many words or letters its "
"content has."
msgstr ""
"Een item afkappen, publiceren of overslaan op grond van hoeveel woorden of "
"letters de inhoud heeft."

